+/*
+ * The state a timer interrupt would have to be taken through, for the boot-arg gicprobe: the CPU
+ * interface's registers and the enable/pending/group bits of the virtual timer's PPI (27) in the
+ * redistributor and the distributor. Printed (the kernel log is what reaches logdump); the
